      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنْوَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A piece of flesh</i> or <i>flesh-meat:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَنَوَاتٌ</span>,
